message: "If you use ULTR-AI in your research, please cite the archived software release."
title: "ULTR-AI: Lung Ultrasound Tuberculosis and Pathology Classification"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - name: "Intelligent Global Health Research Group, EPFL"
abstract: >
  ULTR-AI is research software for training and evaluating deep learning
  models for tuberculosis and lung pathology classification using lung
  ultrasound images.
repository-code: "https://github.com/tbrokowski/UltrAI"
url: "https://github.com/tbrokowski/UltrAI"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - deep learning
  - lung ultrasound
  - medical imaging
  - tuberculosis
